# Generated library output (CORE-488). Everything lives under library/:
# fixtures, manifest, README galleries, and the generated out/ tree. The
# committed baseline was force-added (CORE-72); later rebuilds update those
# tracked files in place.
#
# To refresh the committed baseline, force-add the deliverables BY NAME — a
# bare `git add -f library/out` also sweeps in the .work/ and .results/
# scratch trees:
#   git add -f library/out/compare/images library/out/compare/scoreboard.json
#   git add -f library/out/showcase/images library/out/showcase/inspect.md
#   git add library/README.md library/SHOWCASE.md   # the galleries
library/out/
library/out/compare.baseline/
library/out/showcase.baseline/

# benchmark scratch renders
benchmarks/.work/

# issue-evidence dumps from scripts/pickup.py (evidence lives in Linear)
probe/issue-evidence/

# cocoindex (ccc) local semantic-code index
/.cocoindex_code/

# gate receipt and step logs from scripts/gate.py (CORE-479)
.gate/
